WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV — three-body (30s) Narrator Bill

1
00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:03.921
In software, the person who specifies, the team that builds,

2
00:00:03.921 --> 00:00:07.642
and the operator who runs pull against unwritten assumptions.

3
00:00:08.062 --> 00:00:10.547
Just like three uncoupled bodies in physics,

4
00:00:10.547 --> 00:00:14.953
patching code without checking boundary assumptions shifts failures elsewhere.

5
00:00:15.373 --> 00:00:20.284
Independent landmarks—CompCert's C compiler, seL4's microkernel,

6
00:00:20.284 --> 00:00:25.885
and AWS TLA+ specs—eliminate whole bug classes inside checked boundaries.

7
00:00:26.305 --> 00:00:33.854
Autonomous coding forces implicit human folklore into machine-checkable interface contracts—stabilizing the stack for everyone.
